# Welcome!

#### This professional learning module prepares you to teach **Problem Solving with AI**—a unit which teaches students to move beyond passive use of AI by critically evaluating, refining, and responsibly applying AI-generated content through hands-on experimentation, analysis, and human oversight to improve problem-solving.

___

<div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; width: 95%; margin: 20pt auto; padding: 0 5px;">
  <img src="https://images.code.org/36211eedb3698751fa5523b4dde93351-image-1760467094025.png" style="border-radius: 5pt; width: 32%;">
  <img src="https://images.code.org/7f813b0aec7d472e470f94eb91471aa1-image-1760466945803.png" style="border-radius: 5pt; width: 32%;">
  <img src="https://images.code.org/ddb463a06ccc88f5d7390a1f841a0f31-image-1760467013014.png" style="border-radius: 5pt; width: 32%;">
</div>

___


#### **By the end of this professional learning module, you will be able to:**

* #### Understand how AI generates responses and help students evaluate, question, and improve AI outputs. 
* #### Use structured prompting and multimodal tools to guide students in generating and refining AI-assisted work ethically and effectively. 
* #### Prepare students to design and present AI-assisted solutions through foundational web development and human-centered project work.



## Take Our Pre-Survey

#### To better gauge your learning and improve this professional learning module, please take our pre-survey - it will take fewer than five minutes to complete.

<div style="margin: 20px 0px">
